---
import LegalLayout from '@layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { SITE, mailHref } from '@data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="How refunds, cancellations and course changes are handled at PTCA, including eligibility, processing timelines and admissions confirmation details."
  updated="10 April 2026"
>
  <p>
    The policy below is a general guide. The terms that apply to your enrolment are
    those confirmed in writing by {SITE.legalName} at the time of registration.
    Please confirm with admissions before paying any fee.
  </p>

  <h2>Course cancellation by PTCA</h2>
  <p>
    If a batch is cancelled or materially changed, you will be offered an
    alternative batch, an alternative mode, or a refund of the fee paid.
  </p>

  <h2>Withdrawal by the learner</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Requests received before the first session are assessed on a case-by-case
      basis by admissions.
    </li>
    <li>
      Once sessions have begun, course material has been issued and teaching
      time has been delivered, fee refunds may not be available.
    </li>
    <li>
      Any amount that has already been applied to your registration may be
      deducted.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Transfers</h2>
  <p>
    A confirmed place may be transferable to a later batch or to another
    individual, subject to approval by admissions and availability of seats.
  </p>

  <h2>How to raise a request</h2>
  <p>
    Contact admissions at <a href={mailHref}>{SITE.email}</a> or on WhatsApp at{' '}
    {SITE.phone.display}, quoting your name, the course and the date of
    registration. Responses are provided within a reasonable period after
    receiving the request.
  </p>

  <h2>Note</h2>
  <p>
    Because fees, schedules and batches are agreed with each intake, we strongly
    recommend confirming these terms with admissions before making payment.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>